  <para style="h">Korinto 2</para>
  <para style="toc1">Korinto bi 2</para>
  <para style="toc2">Korinto 2</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kor2</para>
  <para style="mt1">Korinto bi 2</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Anyɛmimɛ Suɔli, Ami Paulo, Yesu Kristo tsɔlɔ nɛ Mawu hla, kɛ wa suɔlɔ nyɛmi Timoteo nɛ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae kɛ mane nyɛ Kristo asafo ɔmɛ kulaa nɛ ngɛ Korinto kɛ Akaia tsuo. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Jɔɔmi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Yi jemi ha wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ ɔ, nɛ ji mɔbɔ nami kɛ bua womi Tsɛ ɔ; <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />nɔ nɛ jɔɔ wa bua, nɛ e haa wɔ tsui ngɛ wa nɔ́ namihi kɛ wa kahi a mi, konɛ wɔ hu wa nyɛ nɛ waa wo nihi nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nae ɔ bua kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu woɔ wɔ hu wa bua a. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ejakaa bɔ nɛ nɔ́ nami aloo amanehlu baa wa nɔ ngɛ Kristo he ɔ, ja a nɔuu kɛ e jɔɔ wa bua nɛ e toɔ wa tsui nɔ nine. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Wa ngɛ amanehlu agbo mi ngɛ Mawu bua womi kɛ yi wami hemi nɛ wa ngɔ kɛ ba ha nyɛ ɔ he. Se Mawu wo wɔ bua ngɛ wa nɔ́ nami ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ enɛ ɔ yeɔ kɛ buaa nyɛ konɛ nyɛɛ na bɔ nɛ Mawu maa wo nyɛ hu bua ha ke nyɛ na amanehlu nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ wa na a eko. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />E ma ha nyɛ he wami nɛ nyɛ kɛ da a nya.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Anyɛmimɛ, e sa nɛ nyɛɛ le bɔ nɛ wa na nɔ́ ngɛ Asia ha. Wa na nɔ́ pe nine nɛ wa hɛ be nɔ kaa wa maa hi je mi tete po. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Wa nu he ngɛ wa mi kaa wa ma gbo, nɛ wa be he wami ko nɛ wa ma kɛ ye kɛ bua wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he; se mohu wa ngɔ wa hɛ ngɔ fɔ Mawu nɛ tleɔ ni gbogboehi si, nɛ lɛ pɛ e ma nyɛ he wa yi wami ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />E ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ e je wɔ kɛ je gbenɔ nɛ ngɛ gbeye mi. Niinɛ, wa he ngɛ nɔ kaa e ma je wɔ ekohu. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Se nyɛ hu nyɛɛ piɛɛ wa he kɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami. Ejakaa nyɛ nɛ nyɛ na wa yiwa nami he ni kpakpa nɛ Mawu tsu kɛ gu nyɛ sɔlemi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔ nɔ ɔ, e sa nɛ nyɛɛ na lɛ si nɛ nyɛ je e yi babauu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Nɔ́ kake nɛ wa fĩaa kɛ fɔɔ nɔ nɛ wa he nile yeɔ he odase ji kaa wa baa wa he si ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ngɛ anɔkuale yemi kɛ klɔuklɔu peemi mi, pi ngɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he ni lemi nya, se mohu wa ngɔɔ wa hɛ kɛ fɔɔ Mawu yemi kɛ buami nɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Munyuhi nɛ i ngmaa kɛ maneɔ nyɛ ɔ a mi tsɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Nɛ e ngɛ mi kaa nyɛ li mi saminya mohu, se ma suɔ nɛ nyɛɛ fĩa ngɔ to ye nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ ami hu i ma fĩa kaa ye nihi ji nyɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu bami ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ngɛ nyɛ nihi a sisi numi kɛ hɛ kɛ nɔ fɔmi ɔ he je ɔ, i to ye yi mi kaa, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />ke i yaa Makedonia a, i ma ba gu nyɛ ngɔ, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ ke i kpale ye se kɛ je Makedonia kɛ ba hu i ma ba nyɛ ngɔ konɛ nyɛ na jɔɔmi si enyɔ, konɛ nyɛ ya je mi blɔ kɛ ya Yudea.<verse eid="2CO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔ́ he je nɛ i kpɛ se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Nyɛ ma bi nɔ́ he je nɛ i tsake ye juɛmi ngɛ. Anɛ i to we ye yi mi tutuutu kaa ma ba nyɛ ngɔ lo? Aloo i ngɛ kaa je mi no nɛ e deɔ ke “ee” be mi nɛ tsa pi ja a nɛ e susu lo? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Dabi! Mawu yeɔ ye he odase kaa tsa pi jamɛ a nɔmlɔ ji mi, ejakaa ke i de ke “ee” ɔ, ja a ji bɔ nɛ i susu.<verse eid="2CO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Yesu Kristo, Mawu Biɔ, he munyu nɛ i kɛ Timoteo kɛ Silvano fiɛ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ, ke e de ke “ee” ɔ, ja a pɛ e ngɛ tsɔɔe, ejakaa e yeɔ nɔ́ nɛ e de ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ejakaa e yeɔ Mawu si womi ɔmɛ kulaa nɔ bɔ nɛ wa de nyɛ ɔ. E ji anɔkualetsɛ nɛ woɔ Mawu hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Mawu nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ pee ami kɛ nyɛ kulaa anɔkualetsɛmɛ ngɛ Kristo mi nɛ e hla wɔ kaa bɔfohi nɛ waa fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Nɛ e kadi wɔ kaa e nihi, nɛ e kɛ e Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ ji e kekle nike ni ɔ wo wa mi kaa e bimɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Mawu nɛ bu mi fɔ ke lakpa nɛ i ngɛ yee; nɛ nɔ nɛ he je nɛ i bɛ nyɛ ngɔ lolo ngɛ ji kaa i be suɔe nɛ ma ka nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ nyɛ ni nɛ pee mɔbɔmɔbɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Akɛnɛ nyɛ nane pi si ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi momo he je ɔ, ke i ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, i be nɔ́ ko tsɔ nɛ ma pee, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ye suɔmi kɛkɛ ji kaa nyɛ na bua jɔmi.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />I pee ye juɛmi kaa i be nyɛ ngɔ bae kɛ kɔmɔ yemi kpa ko hu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyɛ he. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ejakaa ke i ha we nɛ nyɛ na bua jɔmi ɔ, lɛɛ mɛnɔ ji nɔ nɛ ma ha nɛ ye bua maa jɔ mɔ? Nɔ ko be kaa ja nyɛ, nɛ ke i ha nyɛ ye kɔmɔ ɔ, kɛ nyɛ ma plɛ kɛ ha ye bua maa jɔ kɛɛ? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i ngma nyɛ sekpɛ womi ɔ ngɛ ja a nɛ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ dla níhi bɔ nɛ sa loko ma ba; konɛ ke i ba a, níhi nɛ ma ha nɛ ye bua maa jɔ ye he pe kulaa a, mɛ mohu a ko ba wo mi aywilɛho. Ejakaa i ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi kaa nyɛ naa nyɛ bua jɔmi kɛ jee ye bua jɔmi nami mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ja i ba nyɛ ngɔ kɛ bua jɔmi loko nyɛ ma na bua jɔmi.<verse eid="2CO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Jinɛ i sume kaa ma ngma nyɛ jamɛ a womi ɔ. Se tsui yemi kɛ aywilɛho mi nɛ i je kɛ ngma nyɛ, tsa pi nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɔmɔ he je i, se mohu nɛ nyɛɛ na bɔ nɛ i suɔ nyɛ kɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ he nɔ́ dɔɔ mi ha.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5-6" />Nyɛ kai jamɛatsɛ ɔ nɛ kɛ sane nɛ ɔ kulaa ba a, kaa tsa pi ami nɔ kake nɛ e ha i hao, se e ha nyɛ kulaa nyɛ hao pe mi. I sume nɛ ma kã e hɛ mi fuu, ejakaa nyɛ tsuo nyɛ gbe lɛ zo momo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Jehanɛ ɔ, e sa nɛ nyɛ kɛ pa lɛ nɛ nyɛɛ jɔɔ e bua, ke pi ja a, kɔmɔ yemi fuu ma ha nɛ e be e je mi nya nae. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />I kpa nyɛ pɛɛ nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ e na kaa nyɛ suɔ lɛ saminya lolo.<verse eid="2CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛnɔ sa kɛ ha ni tsumi nɛ ɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />I ngma nyɛ jamɛ a womi ɔ konɛ ma kɛ hyɛ ha kaa nyɛ yeɔ ye gbi nɔ lo. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ke nyɛ kɛ nɔ́ ko pa nɔ ko ɔ, ami hu i kɛ paa nyɛ. Nɛ ke i kɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ kɔɔ ye he pa nɔ ko ɔ, i kɛ pa lɛ ngɛ Kristo he wami nya kɛ nyɛ kpakpa nami he je; <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />konɛ Abosiami nɛ ko ye wa nɔ, ejakaa wa le e blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Benɛ i ya su Troa ma a mi ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ ha mi he blɔ nɛ i jaje Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Se ye bua jɔɛ ye he, ejakaa i kɛ ye suɔlɔ Tito ya kpi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, nɛ i li nɔ́ nɛ ba e nɔ hulɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i kɛ mɛ ye sɛ nɛ i pue nɔ kɛ ho Makedonia ya kaa i ma ya na lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ lo.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Se sina ha Mawu, ejakaa kɛ gu nɔ́ nɛ Kristo tsu ɔ nɔ ɔ, e haa wa yeɔ kunimi, nɛ wa jajeɔ Nutsɔ ɔ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ ngɛ he fɛɛ he nɛ a nyaa he. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Mawu ha nɛ Kristo he via liliili ngɛ wa mi. E ji he via nɛ bɔle wɔ kɛ ha nihi nɛ a he a yi wami kɛ nihi nɛ a he we a yi wami tsuo. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Wa he jee gbenɔ he via kɛ haa nihi nɛ a be a yi wami hee ɔ. Nɛ wa he jee wami he via kɛ haa nihi nɛ le Kristo ɔ. Se mɛnɔ nɛ sa ha ni tsumi nɛ ɔ? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Wa be kaa nihi nɛ juaa Mawu Munyu ɔ, se mohu nihi nɛ Mawu tsɔ mɛ nɛ a ngɛ juɛmi. Nɛ wa tuɔ munyu kɛ Kristo he wami ngɛ suɔmi kɛ anɔkuale yemi ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi kaa Kristo sɔmɔli.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi yeɔ wa ni tsumi ɔ he odase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Anɛ pe wa ngɛ wa yi jee kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ lakpa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ hɛɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a yi jemi womi gagahi kɛ baa nyɛ ngɔ ɔ peeɔ lo? E pee we mi kaa nɔ ko yi jemi womi nɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ wa ji he hia nyɛ. Nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ yi jemi he hia we wɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ ji yi jemi womi nɛ i ngɛ hlae, ejakaa ke a na tsakemi kpakpa nɛ ba nyɛ mi ɔ, a maa na kaa wa tsu ni tsumi kpakpa ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />A maa na nyɛ paa kaa womi nɛ wa ngma kɛ je Kristo ngɔ; nɛ tsa pi ningma nyu kɛ ningma tso nɛ a kɛ ngma, se mohu Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ Mumi ɔ nɛ a kɛ ngma; nɛ tsa pi tɛ mi nɛ a kpɛ ngɔ wo hulɔ, se mohu adesahi a tsui mi nɛ a ngma ngɛ.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Wa tuɔ kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he munyu, ejakaa kɛ gu Kristo nɔ ɔ, wa ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami ngɛ Mawu mi kaa e maa ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ wa de ɔ, e maa ba mi; <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />se pi nɛ wa susuu kaa wa ma nyɛ pee nɔ́ ko ngɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he wami nya, ejakaa wa he wami kɛ kunimi yemi ɔ, Mawu ngɔ nɛ e jee. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Lɛ nɛ e ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ wa jaje e blɔ nya tomi he nɛ e ma kɛ he nihi a yi wami ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ. Wa de we mɛ ke a ma gbo ke ji kaa a yi Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ, se mohu, wa ha nɛ a nu sisi kaa a ma na wami ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi, ejakaa ngɛ be nɛ be ɔ mi ɔ, yi wami hemi kɛ gu Kita Nyɔngma amɛ a nɔ yemi ɔ kɛ gbenɔ baa, se ngɛ blɔ nya tomi he ɔ mi ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ haa nɔ yi naa wami.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo anunyami he ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Benɛ Mose ngɔ blema mlaa amɛ nɛ kɛ gbenɔ ba a kɛ ma a, e hɛ mi kpɛ kɛ anunyami bɔ nɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ nyɛ we e hɛ mi nɛ a hyɛ; ejakaa benɛ e kɛ Mawu mlaa a ha mɛ kaa a ye nɔ ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu anunyami ɔ kpɛ ngɛ e hɛ mi. Se jamɛ a hɛ mi kpɛmi ɔ se kɛ we. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Anɛ be nɛ ɔ mi nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ haa wɔ wami ɔ, e sɛ kaa waa hyɛ anunyami nɛ kle pe lɔ ɔ blɔ lo? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ke blɔ nya tomi nɛ woɔ nɔ kɛ yaa gbenɔ mi ɔ he ngɛ anunyami ɔ, anɛ blɔ nya tomi nɛ dlaa nimli kɛ Mawu a kpɛti ɔ he be anunyami nɛ kle pe lɔ ɔ lo? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Niinɛ, wa mwɔnɛ ɔ anunyami ɔ pe sa nɔ́ ɔ kulaa, nɛ a be nyɛe ma kɛ to Mose anunyami ɔ he. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ke kekle blɔ nya tomi nɛ se po ɔ hɛɛ hiɔwe anunyami fuu ɔ, lɛɛ anunyami nɛ Mawu kɛ ha blɔ nya tomi he, kɛ ha wa yi wami hemi mwɔnɛ ɔ hiɛ hluu kɛ be nɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Nɛ akɛnɛ wa ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami kaa kikɛmɛ a anunyami he nɛ ɔ se be poe ɔ, waa fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ kã, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />nɛ wa ko pee kaa Mose nɛ e kɛ hɛ mi hami nɔ́ ha e hɛ mi konɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ nɛ a ko na e hɛ mi nyami nɛ se maa po ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Tsa pi Mose kɛkɛ nɛ a ha e hɛ mi, se e we bi ɔmɛ hu a nga a juɛmi nya, nɛ a nui nɔ́ sisi nɛ a hyɛ we nɔ́ hulɔ. Nɛ kɛ ba si amlɔ nɛ ɔ, a naa ngɛ Ngmami ɔmɛ a kanemi mi kaa a ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ a tsui kɛ a juɛmi nɔ kɛ hɛ mi hami nɔ́ nɛ mi ti; ejakaa a nɛ, nɛ a nui Ngmami ɔ sisi tutuutu. Nɛ ja Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi mi pɛ nɛ a ma nyɛ je hɛ mi hami nɔ́ nɛ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ ligbi nɛ ɔ nɔ́ ɔ, a ha a tsui nɔ, nɛ ke a ngɛ Mose womi ɔmɛ kanee ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ a susuu ji kaa a ma he a yi wami kɛ gu Kita Nyɔngma amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ.<verse eid="2CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Se be fɛɛ be nɛ nɔ ko kpale ngɛ e he yayami ɔmɛ a se kɛ ba Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ ɔ, a jeɔ hɛ mi hami nɔ́ ɔ ngɛ e hɛ mi. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Nutsɔ ɔ ji Mumi nɛ haa mɛ wami ɔ nɛ, nɛ he nɛ Mumi ɔ ngɛ ɔ, lejɛ ɔ he yemi ngɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Se wɔ Kristo we bi ɔmɛ lɛɛ wa be hɛ mi hami nɔ́ ngɛ wa hɛ mi; wa nyɛɔ plɛɔ ahuhuɛ nɛ jeɔ Mawu anunyami kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ. Nɛ si abɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ Mumi ɔ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ wa mi ɔ, wa plɛɔ kaa lɛ nitsɛ.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Akɛnɛ Mawu nitsɛ nɛ ha wɔ kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi nɛ ɔ ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami ɔ nya kaa waa fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ ni kpahi ɔ, wa be he ngmɛe kɛ fɔ si gblee. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Wa mlɔɔ we nɔ ko kaa e he ye; nɛ wa pee we nɔ ko kuasia, nɛ wa tsɔɔ we nɔ́ ko nɔ́ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de we. Wa tsu we zo ni nɛ ɔmɛ. Se kaa bɔ nɛ nihi nɛ le wɔ ɔ yeɔ wa he odase ɔ, wa daa si kpɛii ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi kɛ tuɔ munyu ɔ, nɛ waa kɛ anɔkuale yemi jeɔ Manye Munyu ɔ kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ke a kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ wa fiɛɔ ɔ laa nɔ ko tete po ɔ, lɛɛ nɔ nɛ hɛ mi ma kpata a nɛ a kɛ laa. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Je nɛ ɔ mi mawu nɛ ji Abosiami ɔ nɛ ha nɛ e hɛ yu konɛ e ko na Manye Munyu ɔ e anunyami la a nɛ ngɛ tsoe ha lɛ ɔ, aloo nɛ e ko nu Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ wa ngɛ fiɛe nɛ kɔɔ Kristo nɛ ji Mawu ɔ e anunyami ɔ sisi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Tsa pi wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he nɛ wa ngɛ fiɛe, se mohu Kristo Yesu kaa lɛ ji Nutsɔ; nɛ nɔ́ nɛ wa deɔ ngɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he ji, wɔɔ lɛɛ nyɛ nyɔguɛhi ji wɔ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yesu pee ha wɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ejakaa Mawu nɛ de ke, “La nɛ kpɛ ngɛ diblii ɔ mi”, nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ha wa nu sisi kaa e anunyami kpɛmi ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ a naa ngɛ Yesu Kristo hɛ mi ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa nɔmlɔ tso nɛ puɛɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Se wa dla kikɛmɛ a june nɛ ɔ nɛ ji la kɛ he wami nɛ ngɛ kpɛe ngɛ wa mi amlɔ nɛ ɔ ngɛ wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ nɛ gbɔjɔ nɛ puɛɛ ɔmɛ a mi. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ maa na kaa Mawu anunyami he wami nɛ ngɛ wa mi se pi wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Wa naa haomi ngɛ he fɛɛ he, se wa yeɔ kunimi; wa yi mi peeɔ wɔ sikɔsikɔ ngɛ níhi nɛ baa wa nɔ ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa wa li nɔ nɛ he je nɛ a baa ngɛ, se wa nine mi gbɔjɔɔ we. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />A waa wɔ yi mi, se Mawu kua we wɔ; a fiaa wɔ si, se wa gbo we nɛ wa teɔ si ekohu. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Daa nɛ ɔ, wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ kɛ gbenɔ ngɛ kpee kaa bɔ nɛ e ba mi ha Yesu ɔ; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ naa faii kaa Kristo hɛ kalɔ ɔ nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ nɛ ha wa ngɛ wami mi.<verse eid="2CO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Nɛ daa nɛ ɔ wa ngɛ gbenɔ dɛ mi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ wa ngɛ sɔmɔe ɔ he, se enɛ ɔ haa wɔ he blɔ nɛ wa kɛ jeɔ Yesu Kristo he wami nɛ ngɛ wa nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ gboɔ ɔmɛ a mi ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Wa ngɛ gbenɔ dɛ mi ngɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ wa fiɛɔ ɔ he, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ e pee neneene wami kɛ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Wa deɔ wa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ kɛ kã, kaa bɔ nɛ Latsɛ ɔ ngma ke, “I he ye, nɛ ja a he je ɔ, i de” ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Wa le kaa Mawu ɔ nɛ tle Nutsɔ Yesu si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, lɛ nɔuu nɛ e ma tle wɔ kɛ Yesu si, nɛ e kɛ wɔ kɛ nyɛ tsuo ma ha lɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Nyɛ he je wa ngɛ amanehlu nɛ ɔmɛ nae ngɛ konɛ e pee dloomi kɛ ha nyɛ; konɛ a gu nihi nɛ a kpɔ kɛ ha Kristo ɔ a nɔ kɛ na Mawu si ngɛ e mi mi jɔmi nɛ hiɛ babauu kɛ be nɔ ɔ he, nɛ a wo e hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ wa yi tsui ɔ nɛ; nɛ ke wa kpo nɔ blɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ ngɛ gboe tete po ɔ, wa mi mi blɔ he wami nɛ wa ngɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ ngɛ wae daa ligbi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Wa haomi kɛ wa nɔ́ nami nɛ ɔmɛ pi nɔ́ ko kulaa, nɛ a se be kɛe hulɔ; se mohu a maa wo Mawu neneene gbaami yiblii babauu ha wɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ngɔɛ wa hɛ kɛ fɔɛ níhi nɛ wa ngɛ nae mwɔnɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ, se mohu Hiɔwe bua jɔmi nɛ wa nɛ lolo ɔ blɔ wa ngɛ hyɛe. Nɛ e be kɛ e nɛ haomi ɔmɛ a se maa po, se bua jɔmi nɛ maa ba a maa hi si kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ejakaa wa le kaa ke a ku bo tsu nɛ wa ngɛ mi ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ, aloo ke wa gbo nɛ wa si wa nɔmlɔ tso po ɔ, wa ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso he, nɛ ji we nɛ pi nine nɛ a kɛ ma, se Mawu nitsɛ nɛ po ha wɔ ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ hii si kɛ yaa neneene. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, wa ngɛ nɔ́ nae ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ɔ mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ngɛ hiɔwe nɔmlɔ tso he ɔ nɛ a ma kɛ bu wɔ kaa bo ɔ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Ejakaa ke a ngɔ bu wɔ ɔ, wa be pee kaa mumihi nɛ be nɔmlɔ tso. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Wa ngɛ nɔ́ nae nɛ wa ngɛ kɔmɔ yee ngɛ wa nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ɔ mi; se wa be suɔe kaa ke wa gbo ɔ, wa ko hi nɔmlɔ tso mi. Wa maa suɔ nɛ waa sɛ wa nɔmlɔ tso he ɔmɛ a mi, konɛ neneene wami nɔmlɔ tso ɔ nɛ e mi nɔ́ nɛ gbo ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Enɛ ɔ ji blɔ nya nɛ Mawu to ha wɔ, nɛ e ha wɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kaa se dami ní.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, wa ngɛ hiɔwe nɔmlɔ tso ɔ blɔ hyɛe kɛ hɛ nɔ kami, ejakaa wa le kaa si abɔ nɛ wa ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, waa kɛ wa neneene we ɔ, he nɛ waa kɛ Yesu maa hi si ngɛ ɔ kpɛti kɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Wa le kaa anɔkuale munyuhi ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, ejakaa hemi kɛ yemi nya nɛ wa ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ, se pi ni nami nya. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Nɛ wa yi gbeye, se mohu wa ngɛ gbenɔ he tsui, ejakaa ja wa gbo loko wa ma ya su Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ ngɛ e we ɔ mi. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ɔ mi wa ngɛ jio, pe wa ho hiɔwe ya ngɛ e ngɔ jio, nɔ́ kake nɛ sa wɔ peemi ji kaa waa sa e hɛ mi be fɛɛ be ngɛ wa ni peemi níhi a mi. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ejakaa ja wɔ kulaa wa ya da Kristo kojomi sɛ ɔ hɛ mi, nɛ e kojo wɔ konɛ wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e na níhi nɛ e pee ngɛ zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ ngɛ nɔmlɔ tso mi ɔ he hiɔwo, kpakpa nɛ e pee jio, yayami i jio, kulaa kɛ e hiɔwo.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo tsali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nutsɔ ɔ gbeye yemi nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ he je nɛ wa gboɔ nihi a tsakemi he dengme ngɛ ɔ nɛ. Mawu le kaa nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ je wa tsui mi, nɛ i he ye kaa ngɛ nyɛ he ni lemi mi ɔ, nyɛ hu nyɛ le ja.<verse eid="2CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Tsa pi wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he nɛ wa ngɛ kɔe ha nyɛ ekohu, se mohu waa kɛ nyɛ ngɛ blɔ nɛ hi nɔ fɔe konɛ nyɛɛ fĩa kɛ to wa nɔ, nɛ nyɛ na nɔ́ ko nɛ nyɛ de ni nɛmɛ nɛ fĩaa kɛ toɔ bɔ nɛ a ngɛ ha a nɔ, se pi a tsui mi ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ke godo nɛ wa ngɛ nue ɔ, Mawu hɛ mi nyami nɛ wa kɛ ngɛ woe; nɛ ke pi godo i hu ɔ, e ji se nami kɛ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Tsa pi wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he dengme nɛ wa ngɛ gboe. Wa ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsue, ejakaa Kristo suɔmi ɔ nɛ ngɛ wɔ kpakae amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Nɛ akɛnɛ wa he ye kaa Kristo gbo kɛ ha wɔ tsuo he je ɔ, e sa nɛ wa he ye hu kaa wa gbo kɛ ha he lo nya si himi momo ɔ nɛ wa hi ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />E gbo nihi kulaa a yi gbenɔ konɛ a na neneene wami kɛ je e gbenɔ ɔ mi. A ko hi si kɛ ha mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he hu, se mohu a ba a je mi saminya kɛ wo Kristo nɛ gbo nɛ a tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ngɔ ha mɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ yaa nɛ ɔ, wa ko kojo Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ he lo nya hu, ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ je ɔ susuu ngɛ a he aloo bɔ nɛ wa naa a kpo nɔ blɔ ha a he. Be ko nɛ be ɔ, i susu Kristo he ngɛ he lo nya, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i susuu we e he ja a hu. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ke nɔ ko ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ ɔ plɛ nɔmlɔ he, e pi nɔ́ nɛ e ji kekle ɔ hu, ejakaa e je wami he sisi.<verse eid="2CO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ní he nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa je Mawu ngɔ. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ gu Kristo Yesu nɔ kɛ dla waa kɛ lɛ nitsɛ wa kpɛti. Nɛ e ha wɔ he blɔ kaa wa tsɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ ba e mɔbɔ nami ɔ mi nɛ a kɛ lɛ nɛ ba tsa. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Nyakpɛ munyu nɛ e kɛ ha wɔ kaa waa fiɛɛ kɛ ha ni kpahi ji, Mawu gu Kristo nɔ nɛ e kɛ je ɔ ngɛ huɛ bɔe, nɛ e kojo we mɛ ngɛ a yayami ɔmɛ a he hu. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Kristo tsɔli ji wɔ, nɛ Mawu gu wa nɔ nɛ e kɛ nyɛ ngɛ munyu tue. Wa daa si ngɛ Kristo nane mi nɛ wa ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae ke, nyɛɛ pɛtɛ Mawu suɔmi ɔ he, nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ a dla nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nyɛ kpɛti. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Ejakaa yayami ko be Kristo he, se ngɛ wa he ɔ, Mawu ha nɛ e plɛ yayami peelɔ konɛ kɛ gu e nɔ ɔ, wa plɛ dali ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Wa ngɛ nyɛ nɛ ji Mawu he piɛli ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔ mi ɔ pɛɛ kpae kaa nyɛ ko ha nɛ Mawu dloomi nɛ ɔ nɛ pee yaka gu. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ejakaa Mawu de ke, Nyɛ ngmlaa kpami ɔ ba su mi ngɛ be nɛ sa mi; jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ a bli yi wami hemi agbo ɔmɛ ɔ nɛ. Nɛ i ye kɛ bua nyɛ ngɛ yi wami hemi ligbi ɔ nɔ. Nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mawu ngɛ nyɛ tsɛe. Nyɛ yi wami hemi ligbi ɔ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Wa sume kaa nɔ ko nɛ na tɔmi ko ngɛ wa he nɛ e gbe wa Nutsɔ ɔ he guɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa baa wa je mi bɔ nɛ sa konɛ wa ko tɔ nɔ ko nɔ, aloo wa ko tsi nɔ ko Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ bami blɔ. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Anɔkuale mi ɔ, ngɛ ni tsumi tsuaa ni tsumi mi ɔ, waa kɛ wa he tsɔɔ kaa Mawu sɔmɔli tutuutu ji wɔ; nɛ wa toɔ wa tsui si ngɛ nɔ́ nami kɛ haomi kɛ fimi mi. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />A fiaa wɔ ni nɛ a woɔ wɔ tsu mi, gidigidi peeli ba tuaa wɔ; wa gbo dengme kɛ tsu ni, nɛ mahe hwɔmi kɛ ni yemi be mi. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Waa kɛ wa je mi bami kpakpa kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ sisi numi kɛ wa tsui si tomi tsɔɔ kaa Mawu sɔmɔli ji wɔ. Nɛ wa je wa mi mi jɔmi kɛ anɔkuale suɔmi nɛ hyi kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi ɔ, Mawu he wami ɔ ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ wa ye anɔkuale. Nɛ níhi nɛ ji Mawu sɔmɔlɔ e he bumi kɛ e ta hwumi níhi ɔ, wa ngɛ eko.<verse eid="2CO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Nihi ngɛ wa yi jee jio, a ngɛ wa he guɛ gbee jio, a ngɛ munyu tue kɛ ngɛ wɔ sie jio, e hɛ wui wɔ, wa daa si kpɛii ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ jami ɔ mi. Anɔkualetsɛmɛ ji wɔ, se a tsɛɛ wɔ lakpatsɛmɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Je ɔ bui wa he akɔtaa, se Mawu le wɔ. Wa ngɛ gbenɔ muɔ nya, se nyɛɛ hyɛ wɔ ha, wa gbo we, wa hɛ ngɛ kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ. A plaa wɔ se wa gbo we. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Wa yeɔ tsui, se wa bua jɔɔ daa ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. Ohiafohi ji wɔ, se mohu wa haa nihi fuu mumi dloomi nike ni ɔ kɛ peeɔ mɛ niatsɛmɛ. Wa be nɔ́ ko, se kɛ ɔ, nɔ́ ko he hia we wɔ.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Oo, ye nyɛmimɛ Korinto bi, i de nyɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ ye juɛmi mi. I suɔ nyɛ kɛ ye tsui kulaa. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ke nɔ́ kpa ko ngɛ waa kɛ nyɛ wa kpɛti ɔ, e ji wa ngɔ, ejakaa wa suɔ nyɛ nɛ wa bli wa tsui nya ha nyɛ se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ nga nyɛ tsui nya ngɔ wo wɔ. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />I kɛ nyɛ ngɛ munyu tue kaa nɔ́ nɛ ami nitsɛ ye bimɛ ji nyɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ bli nyɛ tsui mi nɛ nyɛɛ suɔ wɔ kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa suɔ nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ kɛ yayami peeli nɛ ko bɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Nyɛɛ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ he we Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ yi ɔ nɛ ko bɔ huɛ, ejakaa mɛni kake peemi nɛ ngɛ Mawu bimɛ kɛ yayami peeli a kpɛti? Nɛ mɛni kake peemi la kɛ diblii ngɛ? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nɛ mɛni kake peemi Kristo kɛ Abosiami ngɛ? Aloo mɛni bɔmi ngɛ nɔ nɛ heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ kɛ nɔ nɛ he we yi ɔ a kpɛti? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nɛ mɛni kake peemi Mawu sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ wɔhi ngɛ? Ejakaa Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ Sɔlemi Tsu ji nyɛ, nɛ Mawu de ngɛ nyɛ he ke, “Ma hi a mi; nɛ ma nyɛɛ a kpɛti; nɛ ma pee a Mawu nɛ mɛ hu a maa pee ye ma.” <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de ke, “Nyɛɛ je a kpɛti; nɛ nyɛ tsɔ nyɛ he kɛ je a he; nɛ nyɛ ko ta a mu nɔ́ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ ma he nyɛ atuu; <verse eid="2CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />nɛ ma pee nyɛ Tsɛ, nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ maa pee ye bimɛ nyumuhi kɛ yihi.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Mamimɛ suɔli, akɛnɛ a ha wɔ si womi agbo nɛ ɔmɛ he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ wa je wa he kɛ je nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hí ngɛ he lo kɛ mumi mi ɔ mi, nɛ waa tsukɔ wa he nɛ waa kɛ wa he nɛ ha Mawu nɔ kake ngɛ gbeye yemi mi. <verse eid="2CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />I ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae nɛ nyɛ bli nyɛ tsui nya kɛ ha wɔ ekohu, ejakaa wa pee we nyɛ ti nɔ ko yayami ko; wa puɛ we nɔ ko, nɛ wa sisi we nɔ ko. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />I de we nyɛ enɛ ɔ nɛ ma kɛ ka nyɛ hɛ mi aloo nɛ ma kɛ pia nyɛ, ejakaa, kaa bɔ nɛ i de nyɛ momo ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ wa tsui mi daa kɛ daa; nɛ ngɛ yi wami nami mi jio, gbenɔ mi jio, waa kɛ nyɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />I ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami agbo ngɛ nyɛ mi, nɛ i fĩaa ngɔ toɔ nyɛ nɔ. Nyɛ wo mi ka wawɛɛ, nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ ye bua jɔ ye he saminya ngɛ ye nɔ nami ɔmɛ tete a mi.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bua jɔmi baa ngɛ nɔ nami se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Benɛ wa ba Makedonia a, wa jɔɔ we wa he kulaa, nɛ nɔ́ sɔuu kɛkɛ wa ngɛ nae ngɛ wa kpo nɔ blɔ he tsuaa he, nɛ ngɛ wa mi blɔ hu ɔ, gbeye yemi. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Se Mawu, nɔ nɛ jɔɔ nihi nɛ yeɔ kɔmɔ a bua a, e kɛ Tito bami ɔ jɔɔ wa bua. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Tsa pi e bami ɔ kɛkɛ, se mohu bua womi sɛ nɛ e kɛ je nyɛ ngɔ ɔ; ejakaa e ba bɔ wɔ bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi blɔ hyɛe ha, kɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ haomihi nɛ ba ye nɔ ɔmɛ a he kɔmɔ yee, ke nyɛ si fimi kɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kɛ ha mi. Enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa ha nɛ i hyi tɔ kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ke jamɛ a womi ɔ nɛ i mane nyɛ ɔ dɔ nyɛ tete po ɔ, i pia we ye he kaa i ngma. Se kɛ ɔ, e dɔ mi be nɛ i na le kaa e maa dɔ nyɛ ɔ. Se ke e dɔ nyɛ po ɔ, dɔmi ɔ se kɛ we. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e ngɔ ye nya kaa i ngma kɛ mane nyɛ, pi ngɛ dɔmi nɛ e dɔ nyɛ ɔ he, se mohu kaa jamɛ a dɔmi ɔ tsake nyɛ ngɔ pee Mawu bimɛ ɔ he je. E ji dɔmi kpakpa ko nɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi kaa e bimɛ nɛ a na, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ko ba nyɛ ngɔ kɛ abofu ko. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ejakaa, be komɛ ɔ, Mawu yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ kɛ guɔ dɔmi nɛ wa naa a mi. Ejakaa lɔ ɔ haa nɛ wa kpaleɔ ngɛ yayami se nɛ wa hlaa neneene wami se blɔ. E sɛ kaa wa pia Mawu ngɛ he, ejakaa dɔmi nɛ nɔ nɛ he we Mawu nɔ yi naa a, e kɛ tsui tsakemi kpakpa bɛ, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ hu, e tsi we neneene gbenɔ nya.<verse eid="2CO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ kpakpa nɛ dɔmi nɛ nyɛ na kɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ dɛ mi ɔ tsɛ ha nyɛ; e ha nyɛ nu nyɛ he lo sisi kaa e sa nɛ nyɛɛ jɔɔ yayamihi nɛ i ngma nyɛ ngɛ he ɔmɛ peemi. Nyɛ tsui po ngɛ níhi nɛ ba amɛ a he, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi blɔ hyɛe nɛ ma ba ye kɛ bua nyɛ. Nɛ nyɛ tsuɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ baa nyɛ nɔ ɔ he ni pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Tsa pi nɔ nɛ tɔ́ ɔ, loo nɔ nɛ nɔ nɛ a tɔ́ ɔ he je nɛ i ngma nyɛ jamɛ a womi ɔ ngɛ, se mohu bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ je wa he mɔde nɛ nyɛ ngɛ bɔe ɔ kpo paa ngɔ tsɔɔ.<verse eid="2CO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Tsa pi nyɛ suɔmi kɛ he wami womi nɛ ɔ kɛkɛ, se mohu nubwɔ nɛ nyɛ pee Tito ɔ ha nɛ wa bua jɔ wa he kɛ be nɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />I fĩa ngɔ fɔ nyɛ nɔ loko e si mi, nɛ nyɛ gbi mi zo. I tuɔ nyɛ anɔkuale daa, nɛ fiãmi nɛ i fia ngɔ tsɔɔ Tito ɔ ye he odase. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />E suɔ nyɛ pe kekle ɔ, ejakaa e kai bɔ nɛ nyɛ bu lɛ tue kɛ he si bami, kɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ he lɛ atuu nɛ nyɛ ha e hɛ muɔ si ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Enɛ ɔ ha mi bua jɔmi saminya, jehanɛ ɔ nɛ i na kaa wa kpɛti jɔ nɛ i ma nyɛ ma ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ nyɛ nɔ ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi ekohu ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Makedonia bi a mi mi jɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Mamimɛ, ma suɔ nɛ ma de nyɛ dloomi ni tsumi nɛ Mawu tsu kɛ ha Makedonia asafo ɔmɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />E ngɛ mi kaa a ngɛ nɔ nami kɛ he hiami babauu mi mohu, se kɛ ɔ, a bua jɔ a he ngɛ a ohia si himi ɔ mi, nɛ a je a mi mi jɔmi ɔ mi nɛ a ke nihi ni babauu kaa niatsɛmɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Nɛ ma nyɛ ye he odase kaa tsa pi bɔ nɛ a ma nyɛ kɛkɛ nɛ a ha, se a ha kɛ be nɔ po ngɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a suɔmi nya. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />A kpa wɔ pɛɛ kaa waa ngɔ sika nɛ a tsu ɔ kɛ ya ha nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ngɛ Yerusalem bɔ nɛ pee nɛ mɛ hu a na bua jɔmi kaa a ye kɛ bua mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Nɔ́ nɛ a pee nɛ wa hɛ be nɔ́ kulaa ji kaa, a ngɔ a he kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ kekle kɛ wɔ hu, konɛ Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ kudɔ mɛ kɛ gu wa nɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ wa kpa Tito pɛɛ konɛ bɔ nɛ e je ni tsumi ɔ sisi ɔ, e ya nɔ nɛ e wo nyɛ he wami kɛ gbe nya. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ hine hɛ mi nyɛɛli ngɛ nihi fuu mi, ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ munyu tumi kɛ nile kɛ mɔde bɔmi kɛ suɔmi mi ɔ, wa maa suɔ nɛ nyɛɛ pee hɛ mi nyɛɛli ngɛ ni kemi mi ngɛ suɔmi mi hulɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Tsa pi mlaa nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ woe; nɛ i de we ke doo ɔ, nyɛɛ pee hulɔ, se nihi suɔ kaa a maa pee. Nɛ enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a naa nyɛ suɔmi kaa anɔkuale suɔmi, se pi munyu gu tumi.<verse eid="2CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Nyɛ le kaa wa Nutsɔ Yesu hyi tɔ kɛ suɔmi kɛ mi mi jɔmi, ejakaa lɛ nɛ ji niatsɛ ɔ, e plɛ ohiafo ngɛ nyɛ yemi kɛ buami he je, konɛ nyɛɛ gu e ohia a nɔ kɛ plɛ niatsɛmɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />I ngɛ nyɛ slɔe kaa nyɛɛ gbe nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ je sisi jeha ji nɛ ɔ nya, ejakaa nyɛ ji nihi nɛ wo kikɛmɛ a juɛmi nɛ ɔ kɛ ba, nɛ nyɛ nɔuu nɛ nyɛ je sisi hulɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Nyɛ tsa ni tsumi ɔ nɔ kɛ hɛ dɔ nɛ nyɛɛ gbe nya kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ he wami je sisi ɔ, nɛ nyɛ ha bɔ nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ kɛ je bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ mi kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ejakaa ke e je nyɛ tsui mi ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ha bɔ nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ, nɛ e maa muɔ Mawu hɛ kaa nyɛ ha bɔ nɛ nyɛ bua jɔ he, se pi bɔ nɛ nyɛ bua jɔɛ he.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />I de we kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ ke mɛ ni ɔ, a na ni kpɔtɔɔ nɛ a bua nɛ jɔ a he, nɛ nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛɛ hao. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Se mohu ma suɔ kaa nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ nɛ dla nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ mi. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ ni bɔ nɛ sa nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua ni nɛmɛ nɛ e fi mɛ ɔ, konɛ mɛ hu a ye kɛ bua nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ fimi be mi; enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ma na e hiami nɔ́ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ, “Nɔ nɛ bua fuu nya a, e na we kɛ bi nɔ; nɛ nɔ nɛ bua bɔɔ nya a, e na bɔ nɛ sa.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />I naa Mawu si kaa e kɛ nyɛ he mɔde bɔmi nɛ i ngɛ bɔe nɛ ɔ nɔuu wo Tito hu e tsui mi. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Tito bu ye ga womi ɔ tue mohu, se e ji lɛ nitsɛ hu e suɔmi kaa e ba nyɛ ngɔ ekohu nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />E ma nyɛ ngɔ kɛ nyɛmi ko nɛ a le lɛ saminya ngɛ asafo ɔmɛ kulaa a mi kaa Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛlɔ agbo. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Anɔkuale ji kaa asafo ɔmɛ kulaa hla kikɛmɛ a nyɛmi nɛ ɔ nɛ e piɛ ye he nɛ wa wo nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ ya Yerusalem. Enɛ ɔ maa wo Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi nyami nɛ e maa tsɔɔ mɔde nɛ wa ngɛ bɔe nɛ waa ye kɛ bua wa he. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />E piɛɛ wa he, ejakaa wa be suɔe nɛ a tu wa he munyu yaya ko ngɛ nike ni agbo nɛ wa hɛɛ kɛ yaa nɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Mawu le kaa anɔkuale yemi ngɛ wa mi, se i suɔ kaa nimli hu nɛ a na. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je nɛ wa to kikɛmɛ a blɔ nya nɛ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Wa ngɛ nyɛmi kpa ko hu tsɔe kɛ piɛɛ a he; wa ka lɛ ngɛ níhi fuu mi nɛ wa na kaa e yeɔ anɔkuale ngɛ asafo ɔ mi. Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e hɛ dɔ kɛ ha bami ɔ ngɛ e hɛ nɛ e kɛ fɔ nyɛ nɔ ɔ he je, ejakaa i de lɛ kaa nyɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa nɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tito lɛɛ, ye he piɛlɔ nɛ e kɛ mi ngɛ ni tsue kɛ ha nyɛ yemi kɛ buami; nɛ nyɛmimɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ hu, wa asafo ɔmɛ a nane mi dali kɛ Kristo hɛ mi nyami ji mɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ suɔ mɛ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ suɔ mi ɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ pee níhi nɛ wa fiaa kɛ fɔɔ nyɛ nɔ ngɛ mi ɔ kɛ ha mɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />I na kaa e he hia we kaa ma ngma nyɛ nɔ́ ko ngɛ Mawu bi ɔmɛ a yemi kɛ buami he. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ejakaa i le bɔ nɛ nyɛ hɛ dɔ ha, nɛ i fĩa ngɛ he ngɔ tsɔɔ Makedonia bi ɔmɛ kaa Akaia bi dla a he jeha nɛ be ɔ tɔɔ kaa a maa ye kɛ bua. Niinɛ, nyɛ hɛ dɔmi nɛ ɔ wo nihi fuu ka, nɛ a bɔni yee kɛ ngɛ buae. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />I ngɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ tsɔe konɛ fiãmi nɛ wa fĩa kɛ to nyɛ nɔ ɔ, e ko pee fiãmi gu, se mohu a ba na kaa bɔ nɛ wa de mɛ ɔ, nyɛ dla nyɛ he kɛ sika a tsumi. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ye hɛ mi ma pue si, nɛ nyɛ hu zo maa gbe nyɛ ke Makedonia bi ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ kɛ mi ba nɛ a ba na kaa nyɛ dla we nyɛ he kulaa kaa bɔ nɛ wa de mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ ha, Mawu maa to nane mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i tsɔ nyɛmimɛ nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ sɛ ye hlami ngɛ konɛ a ba hyɛ ha kaa nike ni ɔ nɛ nyɛ wo he si ɔ nyɛ nine su nɔ kɛ fɔ si lo. Ma suɔ kaa e pee nike ni nɛ je nyɛ tsui mi, se pi nɔ́ ko nɛ a nyɛ nyɛ nɔ kaa nyɛ ha. <verse eid="2CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Se nyɛ kai enɛ ɔ kaa, ke nyɛ ke nɔ́ ko nyafii ɔ, nyɛ ma na e nane mi tomi nyafii. Ngmɔ hulɔ nɛ duɔ dumi wu bɔɔ ɔ, e kpaa yiblii bɔɔ pɛ, nɛ nɔ nɛ duɔ fuu ɔ, e kpaa yiblii fuu. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ha bɔ nɛ e ma nyɛ kɛ je e tsui mi. Nyɛ ko nyɛ nɔ ko nɔ nɛ e ha pe bɔ nɛ e ma nyɛ, ejakaa Mawu suɔ nɔ nɛ kee ni kɛ jee e tsui mi. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Mawu ngɛ he wami nɛ e maa to nane mi ha nyɛ. E ma ha nyɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ kɛ be nɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ na eko kɛ ye kɛ bua ni kpahi hulɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ke, “Mawu nɔmlɔ naa ohiafo mɔbɔ kɛ jee e tsui mi, nɛ e nɔ́ kpakpa peemi ɔ maa wo e hɛ mi nyami kɛ ya neneene.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nɛ Mawu, nɔ nɛ haa ngmɔ hulɔ dumi wuhi nɛ e duɔ, nɛ lɛ nɔuu e haa e kpaa yiblii fuu nɛ e yeɔ ɔ, e ma ha nyɛ dumi wuhi fuu, nɛ e ma ha yiblii ɔmɛ hu maa ba fuu konɛ nyɛ na eko nɛ nyɛ kɛ ye kɛ bua.<verse eid="2CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Mawu maa pee nyɛ niatsɛmɛ ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi, nɛ nyɛɛ pee nihi nɛ a mi jɔ kɛ nɔ́ kemi be fɛɛ be konɛ ohiafo ɔmɛ a gu wa nɔ kɛ na Mawu si ngɛ nyɛ nike ni ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ejakaa kikɛmɛ a ni kemi nɛ ɔ woɔ yiblii kpakpahi enyɔ. Lɔ ɔ ji e yeɔ kɛ buaa nihi nɛ ngɛ fimi mi, nɛ e haa nɛ a naa Mawu si babauu. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Nihi nɛ nyɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa a, a bua jɔɔ a he ngɛ nyɛ nike ni ɔmɛ a he; nɛ tsa pi lɔ ɔ kɛkɛ, se mohu a jeɔ Mawu yi hulɔ kaa nyɛ ni peemi ni kpakpa amɛ kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ ba a ngɔ ɔ sɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Nɛ mɛ hu a maa sɔle kɛ suɔmi nɛ a ma kpa pɛɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ngɛ Mawu dloomi nɛ a na kɛ gu nyɛ nɔ́ ɔ he.<verse eid="2CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Nyɛ ha nɛ waa na Mawu si ngɛ e Bi nɛ ji e nike ni nɛ he jua wa a he.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo tsɔɔ e he wami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ami Paulo nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae kɛ he si bami kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo nitsɛ maa pee. Se kɛ ɔ, nyɛ ti ni komɛ deɔ ke, ke Paulo ngɛ womi ngmae ngɛ se kɛ mane nyɛ ɔ, e ngmaa kɛ ka. Se ke e na ba su nyɛ ngɔ ɔ lɛɛ e yee gbeye kaa e maa tu munyu.<verse eid="2CO 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />I he ye kaa ke i ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, nyɛ be hae nɛ ma hia ka ngɔ wo nyɛ, ejakaa i be suɔe nɛ ma je ye subai kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ ti nihi nɛ susuu kaa nɔmlɔ gu ji mi ngɛ ni peemi kɛ munyu tumi mi ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />E ngɛ mi kaa nɔmlɔ gu ji mi ngɛ he lo mi mohu, se tsa pi nɔmlɔ blɔ nya tomi nɔ nɛ i guɔ kɛ hwuɔ ye ta amɛ nɛ i yeɔ kunimi. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ejakaa i kɛ he lo mi ta hwumi níhi hwui ta, se mohu Mawu ta hwumi ni ngua amɛ nɛ a kɛ yeɔ Abosiami nɔ ɔ nɛ i kɛ hwuu ta. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Ta hwumi ni nɛ ɔmɛ kuɔ he nɔ womi munyuhi nɛ a kɛ siɔ Mawu nya, kɛ nɔ́ fiaa nɔ nɛ tsiɔ Mawu se blɔ nami nya. Nɛ i kɛ ta hwumi ni nɛ ɔmɛ kpakaa atuã tsɔli kɛ baa Mawu ngɔ, nɛ i tsakeɔ mɛ nɛ a peeɔ Kristo tue buli. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />I kɛ ta hwumi ni nɛ ɔmɛ ma tsu atuã tsɔli tsuo nɛ maa piɛ ɔmɛ a he ni, se ja i kɛ tsu nyɛ he ni kekle nɛ nyɛ ngɔ nyɛ he kɛ ha Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Kpo nɔ níhi kɛkɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hyɛe. Se, ke nɔ ko ngɔ e hɛ fɔ e he nɔ́ kaa Kristo nɔ́ ji lɛ ɔ, lɛɛ e susu he ekohu kaa wɔ hu Kristo níhi ji wɔ kaa lɛ nɔuu. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />E pee we mi zo ke nyɛ ma susu kaa i ngɛ fiãe ngɛ he blɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ ha mi nɛ ma kɛ ye kɛ bua nyɛ ɔ he. I be he blɔ nɛ ɔ woe kɛ kpata nyɛ hɛ mi, se mohu i kɛ maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ hi kɛ pi si. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee konɛ nyɛ ko susu kaa nyɛ he gbeye kɛkɛ nɛ i woɔ ngɛ ye womi ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="2CO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Nyɛ ti ni komɛ deɔ ke, “E womi ɔmɛ nɛ ko hao nyɛ, ejakaa a mi munyuhi jiɔ, nɛ a mi wa mohu, se ke lɛ nitsɛ e ba hiɛ ɔ, nyɛ maa na kaa e pi nɔmlɔ agbo ko, nɛ e munyu ɔmɛ hu a he be se nami.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Jamɛatsɛ ɔ nɛ le kaa mi gbami ko be womihi nɛ wa ngmaa mɛ kɛ jee se ɔmɛ, kɛ wa ni peemi nihi ngɛ a hɛ mi ɔ mi.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />E ko hao nyɛ, ejakaa i be nyɛ nyɛe ma de ke i hi kaa ni komɛ nɛ kɔɔ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he ɔ, ejakaa mɛɛ lɛɛ a kɛ a he toɔ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he, nɛ a kɛ a hɛ fɔɔ a nile nɛ pi ɔ nɔ. A ji nihi nɛ be juɛmi.<verse eid="2CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa be fiãe kɛ fɔ he blɔ nɛ wa be nɔ, se mohu nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ wa hɛ mi ji kaa wa gbo susumi nɛ Mawu to kɛ ha wɔ kɛ wa ni tsumi ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ ɔ he dengme. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Nɛ ke wa de ke wa ngɛ nyɛ nɔ he wami ɔ, wa ngɔɛ nya, ejakaa wɔ ji kekle nihi nɛ kɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ ba su nyɛ ngɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Tsa pi kaa wa ngɛ fiãe ngɛ nɔ kpa ko ni tsumi nɛ e tsu he. Se mohu wa hɛ ngɛ nɔ kaa nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ maa wa, nɛ wa ma tsu ni tsumi nguahi ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu susu nɛ e to kɛ ha wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, wa ma ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ nyɛ se je ma kpa amɛ a mi, hehi nɛ nɔ kpa ko tsu we ni ngɛ ɔ, konɛ e ko ba mi kaa wa ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ hehi nɛ nɔ kpa ko tsu ni ngɛ momo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Kaa bɔ nɛ Ngmami ɔ de ɔ, “Nɔ nɛ fĩaa a, e ko fĩa ngɔ fɔ lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ, se mohu e fĩa ngɔ fɔ nɔ́ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ tsu ɔ nɔ.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ejakaa ke nɔ ko fĩa nɛ e je lɛ nitsɛ e yi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ e tsu he ɔ, e he be se nami, se mohu ke Nutsɔ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ je e yi ɔ, lɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ hi.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />I na nɛ nyɛ na ye kuasia munyu tumi ɔ he tsui. Nyɛ na tsui nɛ ma de nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ mi haoe ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />I jee nyɛ he hunga kɛ he numi nɛ Mawu nitsɛ ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ, kaa nyɛɛ suɔ Kristo nɔ kake too kaa bɔ nɛ zangmayo nɛ he tsɔ kɛ e suɔmi haa nyumu kake nɛ maa pee e huno ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Se i ngɛ gbeye yee kaa a ma puɛ nyɛ juɛmi ngɛ nyɛ klɔuu peemi kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ sɔmɔmi ɔ he, kaa bɔ nɛ Abosiami mlɔɔ Hawa ngɛ abɔɔ ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Nyɛ ngɛ kaa nihi nɛ a lu, ejakaa nyɛ heɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nɔ ko ma de nyɛ ɔ nyɛ yeɔ, ke nɔ ko ba fiɛ Yesu kpa ko he sane ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ nɛ pi wa Yesu ɔ, aloo mumi kpa ko nɛ pi Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ nyɛ nine su nɔ ɔ, aloo blɔ kpa ko nɛ a guɔ nɔ kɛ heɔ yi wami ɔ, nyɛ heɔ lɛ nyɛ yeɔ saminya.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɔ sisili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Se kɛ ɔ, i susuu we kaa kikɛmɛ a “Mawu tsɔli ngua” nɛ ɔmɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ a he ɔ, a hi pe mi ngɛ nɔ́ ko mi. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Ke ye nya mi tɛ kɛ munyu tumi po ɔ, i le nɔ́ nɛ he munyu nɛ i ngɛ tue, nɛ i he ye kaa nyɛ le enɛ ɔ, ejakaa wa jeɔ enɛ ɔ kpo paa ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Akɛnɛ i fiɛ Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ yaka gu ngɛ he si bami mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a wo nyɛ nɔ́ ɔ, anɛ i pee yayami lo? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Benɛ i ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, asafo kpahi nɛ wo mi hiɔ. E ngɛ kaa nɔ nɛ i ju mɛ kɛ ba ye bua nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Nɛ benɛ lɔ ɔ ta, nɛ i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɛ ohia ngɛ mi yee ɔ, i bi we nyɛ nɔ́ ko, ejakaa nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ je Makedonia a ba ha mi ye hiami níhi tsuo. I bi we nyɛ pɛsua hyɛ, nɛ i be nyɛ nɔ́ ko bie gblee. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />I da Kristo anɔkuale ɔ nɛ ngɛ ye mi ɔ nɔ nɛ i ngɛ si woe kaa i ma tu enɛ ɔ he munyu ngɔ tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Akaia. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Mɛni he i? Akɛnɛ i sume nyɛ he i lo? Mawu le kaa i suɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Se mohu ma pee nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee nɛ ɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma tsi nihi nɛ ngɛ fiãe kaa mɛ hu a ngɛ Mawu ni tsumi tsue kaa bɔ nɛ wa ngɛ tsue ɔ a nya.<verse eid="2CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Mawu tsɔɛ kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ; lakpatsɛmɛ kɛ nɔ sisili nɛ tsakee a he ngɔ peeɔ Kristo bɔfohi ji mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Se kɛ ɔ, enɛ ɔ pee we mi nyakpɛ, ejakaa Abosiami tsakeɔ e he kɛ peeɔ la bɔfo; <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e be nyakpɛ kaa e sɔmɔli ɔmɛ hu ma nyɛ tsake a he kɛ pee bɔfo klɔuuhi. Se a ma na a ni tsumi ɔmɛ a he hiɔwo ngɛ nyagbe ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee ekohu ke, nyɛ ko bu mi kuasia ngɛ munyu nɛ i ngɛ tue kaa kikɛ ɔ he, se ke nyɛ susu ja a po ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ bie nɛ nyɛɛ bu mi tue kɛkɛ, konɛ ami hu ma fĩa bɔɔ kaa mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Ní nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee nɛ ɔ, e pi Mawu suɔmi nya munyu nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ tue, ejakaa i ngɛ munyu tue kaa kuasia tuɔ munyu. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Se akɛnɛ jamɛ a nimli ɔmɛ fĩaa ngɛ he lo nya he je ɔ, ami hu ma fĩa ja. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Nyɛ buu nyɛ he ni leli, se nyɛ buu jamɛ a kuasia amɛ tue kɛ bua jɔmi, <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />nɛ a yeɔ nyɛ nyɔguɛ nɛ a kpɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, aloo ke a bui nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ ko mi aloo a ngɛ a he nɔ woe ngɛ nyɛ nɔ, aloo ke a gba nyɛ hɛ mi ma tete ɔ, e hɛwi nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />I kɛ zo ngɛ dee ke wa be nyɛ nɔ jamɛ a he wami ɔ. Se nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a fĩaa ngɔ toɔ nɔ ɔ, ami hu ma fia ngɔ to nɔ kaa mɛ nɔuu. E peeɔ mi kaa i ngɛ munyu tue kaa kuasia ekohu ngɛ hiɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />A fĩaa ke Hebri bi ji mɛ, e ngɛ mi ja a lo? Ami hu eko ji mi. Nɛ a deɔ ke mɛ ji Israel bi nɛ Mawu hla a nɛ. Ami hu eko ji mi. Anɛ a ke Abraham bimɛ ji mɛ lo? Ami hu eko ji mi.<verse eid="2CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />A ke Kristo sɔmɔli ji mɛ lo? Lɛɛ i pe mɛ! Anɛ i ngɛ munyu tue kaa nɔ nɛ yi mi puɛ lo? I gbo dengme kɛ tsu ni. A wo mi tsu mi si abɔ; a fiaa mi kpa si abɔ, nɛ i su gbenɔ muɔ nya si abɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ fiaa mi kpa si enuɔ sɔuu, eko fɛɛ eko mi ɔ, a fiaa mi kpa nyingmi etɛ kɛ nɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />A fiaa mi dade kpa si etɛ; a fiaa mi tɛ si kake, nɛ i kɛ pa nɔ lɛ ya butu si etɛ. I tlɔ wo nɔ nyɔ kɛ pia si kake. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />I hia blɔ kɛ ya hehi fuu, nɛ i na nɔ ngɛ pahi nɛ hia a nɔ; nɛ i na nɔ ngɛ ojo fiali kɛ ye wekuli Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ tsuo a dɛ mi. Ja a nɔuu i ná oslaa agbohi ngɛ awi yeli a dɛ mi ngɛ mahi a mi, kɛ ngahi a nɔ, kɛ wohi a nɔ, kɛ nihi nɛ tsɛɔ a he nyɛmimɛ ngɛ Kristo mi se a be ja a, a dɛ mi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Nɛ pɔ tɔɔ mi ngɛ ni tsumi kɛ nyɔ fɔmi mi; nɛ behi fuu ɔ, hwɔ kɛ kuma ye mi. I ha hwɔ nɛ i nyɛɛ fiɛ̃ mi nɛ fiɛ̃ ye mi, ejakaa i be tade bɔ nɛ sa nɛ i woɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Tsa pi enɛ ɔmɛ kɛkɛ, se mohu i yeɔ asafo ɔmɛ hu a nɔ yami he kɔmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ke nɔ ko gbɔjɔ ɔ, i nuɔ he haa lɛ; nɛ ke nɔ ko nane tɔtɔ ɔ, ye mi mi saa mi ngɛ e he.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Se ke e he hia kaa ma fĩa a, lɛɛ i ma fia ngɔ fɔ ye gbɔjɔmi níhi a nɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Mawu nɛ ji wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo Tsɛ, nɔ nɛ sa yi jemi daa kɛ daa a, le kaa i tuɔ anɔkuale. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Benɛ i ngɛ Damasko ɔ, asafoatsɛ nɛ ngɛ matsɛ Areta sisi ɔ ha a hwɔɔ mi ngɛ Damasko agbo ɔmɛ a nya konɛ a nu mi. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Se a kɛ mi wo kusii mi kɛ gu gli puɔ mi kɛ kple si nɛ i tu fo kɛ je a dɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu he wami jeɔ e he si ngɛ gbɔjɔmi mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Se nami ko be fiami nɛ ɔ he. Se kɛ ɔ, ma de nyɛ ni namihi kɛ Nutsɔ ɔ kpo jemihi nɛ i na. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2-3" />I le nyumu Mawu jalɔ ko nɛ jeha nyɔngma kɛ eywiɛ ji nɛ ɔ, a sa lɛ kɛ ho hiɔwe lokoo ya. Se i li kaa nɔmlɔ tso mi nɛ e ngɛ aloo mumi mi nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ho lo, Mawu nɛ le. A sa lɛ kɛ ho Paradeiso ya, <verse eid="2CO 12:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />nɛ e ya nu munyuhi nɛ nɔmlɔ adesa juɛmi sui he, nɛ e be he blɔ nɛ e tsiɔ tã deɔ nɔ ko tete. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ma fĩa ngɛ nɔmlɔ kaa kikɛ ɔ nɔ, se i be fiãe ngɛ ami nitsɛ ye nɔ, kaa ja ngɛ ye gbɔjɔmi ɔmɛ a he, kɛ bɔ nɛ Mawu guɔ ye gbɔjɔmi ɔ nɔ kɛ woɔ e hɛ mi nyami. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ke ma fĩa a, i ngɛ níhi fuu nɛ ma fĩa ngɛ he, se i be kuasia jee, ejakaa i be suɔe nɛ nɔ ko nɛ bu mi pe bɔ nɛ e naa mi, aloo nɔ́ nɛ e nuɔ ngɛ ye nya.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ko wo ye he nɔ ngɛ nyakpɛ kpo jemi níhi agbo nɛ ɔmɛ a he heje ɔ, a to mi okadi ko, kaa mio nɛ ji Abosiami tsɔlɔ ɔ, e hi ye he womi mi konɛ e gbɔɔ mi nɛ e hao mi. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />I kpa Mawu pɛɛ si etɛ sɔuu nɛ i bi lɛ konɛ e ha nɛ ma na he wami ekohu.<verse eid="2CO 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Se ngɛ eko fɛɛ eko mi ɔ, e de mi ke, “Dabi! I kɛ mo ngɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ he hia mo, ejakaa ye he wami ɔ jeɔ e he si ngɛ nihi nɛ gbɔjɔ ɔmɛ a mi.” Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ngɔɔ ye nya saminya kaa ma fĩa kɛ fɔ ye gbɔjɔmi ɔ nɔ mohu konɛ ma na Kristo he wami ɔ ngɛ ye mi nɛ e bu ye he. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Akɛnɛ i le kaa Kristo he je nɛ i ngɛ haomi nae ngɛ ɔ, ye bua jɔ “mio ɔ” kɛ jɛmi ɔmɛ kɛ nɔ nami ɔmɛ kɛ yi mi wami ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa i naa he wami kɛ guɔ gbɔjɔmi ɔ mi, nɛ si abɔ nɛ e fi mi ɔ, si abɔ nɛ i ngɔɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔɔ e nɔ ji lɔ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ i je kuasia kɛ fiami nɛ ɔ nɛ; nyɛ ji nihi nɛ sa nɛ nyɛ ngmaa kɛ jeɔ ye yi, se pi ami nitsɛ, ejakaa i be nɔ́ ko mi mohu, se e piɛ we nɔ́ ko nɛ bɔfo nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ nɛ i be eko. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ejakaa i ha nɛ nyɛ na paa ngɛ okadihi kɛ nyakpɛ nihi kɛ he wami ni tsumihi nɛ i kɛ tsui si tomi tsu ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ kaa Mawu nitsɛ bɔfo nɛ e tsɔ nyɛ ngɔ ji mi. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Se nɔ́ kake nɛ i pee ngɛ asafo kpa amɛ a mi se i pee we ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ ji kaa i bi we nyɛ ke nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua mi. I kpa nyɛ pɛɛ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ kikɛmɛ a tɔmi nɛ ɔ nɛ pa mi.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I ma ekohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />I ma nyɛ ngɔ ekohu nɔ́ nɛ ji si etɛ, nɛ i kɛ ye he ba be nyɛ nɔ fɔe ja a nɔuu, ejakaa tsa pi nyɛ sika nɛ i ngɛ hlae, se mohu nyɛ nitsɛmɛ. Ye bimɛ ji nyɛ, nɛ e sɛ kaa bimɛ woɔ a fɔli a niye ni he hiɔ, se mohu fɔli nɛ sa kaa a hlaa niye ni kɛ haa a bimɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />E ngɔ ye nya kaa ma ngɔ ye he kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ i ngɛ kɛ ha nyɛ klaa amɛ a yi wami hemi. Anɛ ke i suɔ nyɛ saminya kikɛ ɔ, e sɛ kaa nyɛ hu nyɛɛ suɔ mi ja a lo?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Nyɛ ti ni komɛ ngɛ dee ke, “Jamɛ a Paulo ɔ, e hɛ mi tɛ; e ji anɔkuale sane kaa ke e ba wa ngɔ ɔ, e kɛ e hɛ fɔɛ wa nɔ mohu, se e sisiɔ wɔ nɛ e naa nɔ́ ko kɛ kɛ jee wa ngɔ.”<verse eid="2CO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Se kɛ nyɛ ngɛ tsɔɔe kɛɛ? Anɛ i gu tsɔli nɛ i tsɔɔ nyɛ ngɔ ɔ a ti nɔ ko nɔ kɛ sisi nyɛ lo? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Benɛ i kpa Tito pɛɛ nɛ i tsɔ lɛ kɛ wa nyɛmi ɔ kɛ mane nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, anɛ a ba ye nyɛ se lo? Dabi, i he we yi, ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu kake ɔ nɛ ngɛ wɔ tsuo wa mi, nɛ wa ngɛ wa si bi a nane mami he ɔmɛ a mi nyɛɛe, nɛ wa ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ blɔ kake nɔ.<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Eko ɔ, nyɛ ma susu kaa wa nya nɛ i ngɛ jee. Pi ja i kulaa, Mawu hɛ mi nɛ i ngɛ dee ngɛ kaa Kristo we bi. Suɔli, i ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo pee, pi nɛ ma kɛ ye kɛ bua ami nitsɛ ye he, se bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ nane nɛ pi si ngɛ mumi ɔ mi. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ejakaa i ngɛ gbeye yee kaa eko ɔ, ke i ba nyɛ slaami ɔ, i be nɔ́ nɛ ma ba na a suɔe, nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ be bɔ nɛ ma pee ɔ suɔe. I ngɛ gbeye yee kaa i ma ba na nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pɛe, nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ bi nyɛe, nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ bi a mi mi la woe, nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he nɔ woe, kɛ sieku yemi, munyu hwitihwiti tumi, nɛ kake peemi be nyɛ kpɛti. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />I ngɛ gbeye yee kaa ke i ba a, ye Mawu ɔ maa ba mi si ekohu ngɛ nyɛ hɛ mi, nɛ ye ni maa pee mɔbɔ nɛ i ma ye kɔmɔ, ejakaa nihi nɛ pee yayami sa a, a tsakee we a tsui. A ti nihi fuu ngɛ a yi kpɛti wami kɛ a mu ni ɔmɛ nɛ ji ajuama bɔmi kɛ yahomi ɔmɛ a mi lolo.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Enɛ ɔ ji si etɛ nɛ i ma nyɛ slaami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ngmami ɔ tsɔɔ kaa a ma sane tsuaa sane nɛ ni enyɔ loo etɛ ye he odase ɔ nya si. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />I wo nihi nɛ ngɛ yayami pee ɔ si benɛ i ba nyɛ ngɔ nɔ́ nɛ ji si enyɔ ɔ, nɛ ja a nɔuu i ngɛ mɛ kɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ dee ke, ke i ba ekohu ɔ, i kɛ a he be mɛ kee.<verse eid="2CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Nyɛ maa na okadi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ konɛ nyɛɛ na kaa Kristo tuɔ munyu kɛ guɔ ye nɔ. Kristo gbɔjɔɔ we se mohu e ngɛ he wami agbo ngɛ nyɛ mi. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />A sɛu e Nɔmlɔ tso nɛ gbɔjɔ ɔ ngɛ tso nɔ nɛ e gbo, se Kristo hɛ ngɛ ngɛ Mawu he wami nya. Ja a nɔuu wɔ hu wa gbɔjɔ ngɛ wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ a mi, se piɔ ɔ, wa hɛ ngɛ nɛ wa ngɛ he wami kaa lɛ, nɛ wa hɛɛ Mawu he wami ɔ nɛ wa ma kɛ tsu nyɛ he ni.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ ka nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Nyɛɛ ka nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ ha kaa Kristo se nyɛɛli ji nyɛ niinɛ lo? Kɛ nyɛ na kɛɛ? Anɛ nyɛ nuɔ Kristo kɛ e he wami ɔ he ngɛ nyɛ mi lo? Aloo nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he mlɔɔe ke Kristo se nyɛɛli ji nyɛ, be mi nɛ ngɛ anɔkuale mi ɔ, nyɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛli? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />I heɔ yeɔ kaa nyɛ le kaa wɔɔ lɛɛ wa yeɔ kunimi akɛnɛ Kristo níhi ji wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />I ngɛ Mawu pɛɛ kpae kaa nyɛ ko pee yayami, pi kaa nɛ wa na yi jemi he je, se mohu konɛ a na kaa ke a ngɛ wa he guɛ gbee tete ɔ, nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ nɛ da. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Wa ni tsumi ji kaa waa hyɛ nɛ a pee nɔ́ nɛ da be fɛɛ be nɛ wa ko hyɛ yayami blɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Wa naa bua jɔmi ke wa gbɔjɔ nɛ a gbe wa he guɛ nɛ nyɛ mohu nyɛ ngɛ he wami ɔ. Nɛ wa suɔmi kɛ pɛɛ kpami ji kaa nyɛɛ pee Kristo se nyɛɛli kpakpahi.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae ngɛ konɛ ke i ba a, ma ko ba kã nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ ma gbla nyɛ tue kɛ hɛ dɔ, ejakaa i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma tsu he blɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ha mi kɛ ha nyɛ dlami se pi nyɛ puɛmi ɔ he ni.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Nyagbe ɔ, mamimɛ, nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ; nyɛɛ hi kɛ pi si ngɛ Kristo mi. Nyɛɛ bu níhi nɛ i de nyɛ ɔ tue; nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ kake peemi kɛ he jɔmi mi, nɛ suɔmi kɛ he jɔmi Mawu ɔ kɛ nyɛ maa hi si. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Nyɛ nga nyɛ he kɛ bua jɔmi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ kulaa ke a biɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi ɔ, kɛ Mawu suɔmi ɔ, kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu huɛ bɔmi ɔ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>